 62CR c  Theoretical nuclear structure calculations:                            
 62CR c  2023Li18: calculated energy levels, J|p, B(E2), effective              
 62CR2c  single-particle energies (ESPEs) using shell model, discussed merging  
 62CR3c  of the island of inversion.                                            
 62CR c  2022He16: calculated S(2n), rms charge radius, proton and neutron      
 62CR2c  density distribution using relativistic Hartree-Bogoliubov model with  
 62CR3c  density-dependent meson-exchange relativistic energy functionals.      
 62CR c  2022Ho02: calculated quadrupole deformation parameter |b{-2}, S(2n),   
 62CR2c  rms matter radius, hexadecapole deformation parameter |b{-4},          
 62CR3c  cumulative single-particle hexadecapole moment of N=38 isotones,       
 62CR4c  difference of the charge square radii, diffuseness parameters using    
 62CR5c  Skyrme-Hartree-Fock method in three-dimensional coordinate space.      
 62CR c  2021Ga02: calculated levels, J|p, B(E2) using shell-model with         
 62CR2c  Lenzi-Nowacki-Poves-Sieja (LNPS) interaction.                          
 62CR c  2020Na28: calculated energy levels, J|p, B(E2), B(>), deformation      
 62CR2c  parameters, potential energy surface using interacting boson model.    
 62CR c  2018Sa40: calculated potential energy curves, T{-1/2}, Q(|b{+-}),      
 62CR2c  |b{+-}n probability, Gamow-Teller strength distributions using         
 62CR3c  constrained HF+BCS with Skyrme force SLy4.                             
 62CR c  2014Ji14: calculated levels, J|p, deformation of ground state,         
 62CR2c  B(E2) of collective states using macroscopic-microscopic model.        
 62CR c  2014Ko16: calculated levels, J|p, B(E2), E(4+)/E(2+), E(6+)/E(4+),     
 62CR2c  quadrupole moment, energy surface contours in (|b-|g) plane using      
 62CR3c  proton-neutron interacting boson model (IBM-2) and interacting         
 62CR4c  shell model (ISM).                                                     
 62CR c  2013Ba30: calculated binding energy, quadrupole moment, potential      
 62CR2c  energy surface, single-particle levels, ground state charge radius     
 62CR3c  using self-consistent RMF theory with effective interactions.          
 62CR c  2013Ts02: calculated low-lying levels, J|p, B(E2), deformation using   
 62CR2c  large-scale Monte Carlo shell model.                                   
 62CR c  2012Ca30: calculated energy levels, J|p, electric quadrupole and       
 62CR2c  dipole magnetic moments using shell model with FPD6 and GXPF1          
 62CR3c  interactions.                                                          
 62CR c  2012Ro39: calculated B(E2), B(E3) as function of |b{-2} using angular  
 62CR2c  momentum projection with the rotational formula and spherical limit,   
 62CR3c  and nean-field wave functions in the HFB approximation with Gogny      
 62CR4c  D1S interaction assuming axial symmetry.                               
 62CR c  2012Sa33: calculated potential energy surface contours in |b-|g plane, 
 62CR2c  levels, J|p, B(E2), E0 transition strengths with solution of           
 62CR3c  Schrodinger equation for five-dimensional quadrupole collective        
 62CR4c  Hamiltonian, with constrained Hartree-Fock-Bogoliubov plus local       
 62CR5c  quasiparticle random-phase approximation (CHFB+LQRPA) method.          
 62CR c  2011Yo04: calculated total energy curves, energies of first 2+ and 4+  
 62CR2c  states, B(E2), spectroscopic quadrupole moment of the first 2+ state,  
 62CR3c  rms radius, quadrupole masses, and collective wave functions of ground 
 62CR4c  state using microscopic model based on Skyrme and the pairing energy   
 62CR5c  density functionals (EDF).                                             
 62CR c  2010Le20: calculated levels, J|p, B(E2), quadrupole moment, occupation 
 62CR2c  of neutron intruder orbitals and percentage of particle-hole           
 62CR3c  excitations using interacting shell-model with {+48}Ca core and        
 62CR4c  effective interaction based on G matrix; discussed island of inversion 
 62CR5c  around N=40.                                                           
 62CR c  2010Ya17: calculated moments of inertia of yrast bands, and energies of
 62CR2c  yrast, 2-qp and 4-qp configurations using projected shell model (PSM). 
 62CR c  2008Ka41: calculated levels, J|p, B(E2), single-particle energies using
 62CR2c  shell model.                                                           
 62CR c  2008Yo02: calculated single-particle energies, excitation energies,    
 62CR2c  transition densities, QPRA amplitudes, B(E2), isoscalar quadrupole,    
 62CR3c  monopole pair and quadrupole pair transition strengths for K|p=0+      
 62CR4c  states using quasiparticle random phase approximation, and             
 62CR5c  Hartree-Fock-Bogoliubov formalism.                                     
 62CR c  2002Ca48: calculated level energies, J|p, B(E2) using large-scale      
 62CR2c  shell model calculations                                               
