 62FE c  1975Fr16: identification and production of {+62}Fe in                  
 62FE2c  {+64}Ni(n,2pn) reaction at E(n)=25-200 MeV, neutron beam of the        
 62FE3c  200-MeV LINAC at BNL. Identification from monitoring of decay of       
 62FE4c  {+62}Fe and growth of {+62}Co. Measured E|g, half-life                 
 62FE c  Delayed neutron decay of {+63}Mn is allowed and, in principle, can     
 62FE2c  populate levels in {+62}Fe, but there is no experimental information   
 62FE3c  available for this decay mode                                          
 62FE c  Mass measurement: 2012Na15                                             
 62FE c                                                                         
 62FE c  Theoretical nuclear structure calculations:                            
 62FE c  2022Ho02: calculated quadrupole deformation parameter |b{-2}, S(2n),   
 62FE2c  rms matter radius, hexadecapole deformation parameter |b{-4},          
 62FE3c  difference of the charge square radii, diffuseness parameters using    
 62FE4c  Skyrme-Hartree-Fock method in three-dimensional coordinate space.      
 62FE c  2022Ko04: calculated ground state energy, charge rms radius using      
 62FE2c  coupled cluster (|a) and ab-initio density functional theory, extended 
 62FE3c  to open-shell deformed nuclei.                                         
 62FE c  2021Ob02: calculated energy levels, J|p, B(E2), deformation parameters,
 62FE2c  using shell model.                                                     
 62FE c  2017Sc04: calculated energy levels, J|p B(E2), B(M1) using large-scale 
 62FE2c  shall model.                                                           
 62FE c  2014Ji14: calculated levels, J|p, deformation of ground state, B(E2)   
 62FE2c  of collective states, potential energy surface using mean-field models.
 62FE c  2014Ko16: calculated levels, J|p, B(E2), E(4+)/E(2+), E(6+)/E(4+),     
 62FE2c  quadrupole moment, energy surface contour in (|b-|g) plane using       
 62FE3c  proton-neutron interacting boson model (IBM-2) and interacting         
 62FE4c  shell model (ISM).                                                     
 62FE c  2012Lo04: calculated M1 transition strength distribution for ground    
 62FE2c  and low-lying states using shell model with {+40},{+48}Ca core and     
 62FE3c  KB3Gmod interaction; and compared with single-particle calculation     
 62FE4c  and Kopecky formula.                                                   
 62FE c  2010Le20: calculated levels, J|p, B(E2), quadrupole moment, occupation 
 62FE2c  of neutron intruder orbitals and percentage of particle-hole           
 62FE3c  excitations using interacting shell-model framework in full {Ipf}      
 62FE4c  valence space with {+48}Ca core and G-matrix effective interaction.    
 62FE c  2010Sr02, 2009Sr01: calculated levels, J|p, quadrupole moments, B(E2), 
 62FE2c  wave functions, occupation numbers using large-scale shell model with  
 62FE3c  GXPF1A interaction.                                                    
 62FE c  2009Su20: calculated levels, J|p, moment of inertia, B(E2), deformation
 62FE2c  parameters, yrast band up to 20+ using projected shell-model.          
 62FE c  2002Ca48: calculated level energies, J|p, B(E2) using large-scale      
 62FE2c  shell model.                                                           
