 62CO    26MG(48CA,3NP2AG)             2022SE03                  25NDS    202507
 62CO  H TYP=FUL$AUT=Balraj Singh, Huang Xiaolong, and Wang Xianghan$           
 62CO2 H CIT=NDS 204, 1 (2025)$CUT=30-Jun-2023$                                 
 62CO c  2022Se03: E({+48}Ca)=275,290,320 MeV. Measured E|g, I|g,               
 62CO2c  |g|g-coin, |g(|q) at 17.3|', 31.7|', 37.4|', 50.1|', 58.3|', 69.8|',   
 62CO3c  79.9|', and 90.0|' with respect to the beam direction,                 
 62CO4c  |g|g(|q)(ADO ratios) using Gammasphere array with                      
 62CO3c  101 Compton suppressed HPGe detectors, the Fragment Mass Analyzer      
 62CO4c  (FMA), a Micro-Channel Plate (MCP) detector to provide clean channel   
 62CO5c  selection and a threefold ionization chamber at the ATLAS-ANL facility.
 62CO6c  Deduced a magnetic dipole rotational band from particle-rotor model    
 62CO7c  (PRM) calculations. Comparison with large-scale shell-model            
 62CO8c  calculations using the NuShellX code in the full {Ifp} model space     
 62CO9c  with the GXPF1A interaction.                                           
 62CO cG $For |g(|q) data, 2022Se03 associate positive A{-2} value with pure    
 62CO2cG |DJ=2 (E2) transitions and a negative A{-2} with |DJ=1 transitions.    
