 62NI2cL to be published (ref. 53 in 2023Sp03); partial data from (|g,|g') are  
 62NI3cL presented in Fig. 8d of 2023Sp03. As details of (|g,|g') data are not  
 62NI4cL available, evaluators consider J=1 assignments as tentative, thus      
 62NI5cL placed in parentheses.                                                 
