 62NI6c  levels (g.s., 1178, 2+ and 2340, 4+) investigated. This work deals     
 62NI7c  mainly with reaction mechanism. The (t,p) enhancement factors          
 62NI8c  calculated for different orbitals assigned to these three states.      
