 62NI3c  from the resonant line in {+62}Ni at 7646 keV using two Ge(Li)         
 62NI4c  detectors, and nickel targets of 10 g/cm{+2} and 2 g/cm{+2} thickness  
 62NI5c  at the IRR-2 reactor facility of the Nuclear Research Center-Negev,    
 62NI6c  Beer-Sheva. 1974Mo15 investigated temperature effect of resonantly     
 62NI7c  scattered capture |g rays in the range 4.2 K to 670 K. Deduced         
 62NI8c  radiative width of the 7640-keV level                                  
