 62NI c  1962Jo05: (d,d'),E(d)=15 MeV. Measured deuteron spectra, |s(|q) using  
 62NI2c  a magnet spectrograph, and photographic emulsion plates, with          
 62NI3c  FWHM=40 keV at the University of Pittsburgh. Data analyzed using       
 62NI4c  Blair phase rule, which was found invalid for Ni isotopes.             
 62NI c  1969Jo01: (d,d'),E(d)=11.5,11.8 MeV from Harwell tandem Van de Graaff  
 62NI2c  accelerator. Measured deuteron spectra using Buechner magnetic         
 62NI3c  spectrometer with FWHM=25 keV. DWBA analysis of |s(|q) distributions.  
 62NI4c  Data for the first 2+ and 3- states.                                   
 62NI c  1963Ne09: (d,d'),E(d)=13.6 MeV. Measured deuteron spectrum using       
 62NI2c  ionization chamber. Level at 1170 with L=2 reported.                   
 62NI c  1977WoZU: (pol d,d'),E(d)=6-12 MeV. Measured deuteron spectrum, |s(|q),
 62NI2c  A{-y}(|q)                                                              
 62NI c  1974Ba74: (pol d,d'),E(d)=15 MeV, vector and tensor polarized deuteron 
 62NI2c  beams from Rutgers-Bell FN tandem accelerator. Measured deuteron       
 62NI3c  spectra, |s(|q), analyzing powers iT{-11}(|q) using solid-state counter
