 62NI2c  Graaff accelerator. Measured E(p), I(p), |s(|q) using a cooled surface 
 62NI3c  barrier silicon detector, and |?99% enriched {+62}Ni target of 250     
 62NI4c  |mg/cm{+2} thickness with a backing of 30 |mg carbon. FWHM|?20 keV.    
 62NI5c  DWBA analysis of |s(|q) data. Authors, in Table 1 give level energies  
 62NI6c  of 40 excited states from 1170 keV to 8200 keV from their (p,p'|g)     
