 62CU c  1973Bl07: (p,n|g) and (d,n|g); E(p)=5.8 MeV, E(d)=6.5 MeV, pulsed beam.
 62CU2c  Measured E|g, level T{-1/2} by |g|g(t), g factor by time differential  
