 62ZN    32SI(30SI,X):GDR              2021GO15                  25NDS    202507
 62ZN  H TYP=FUL$AUT=Balraj Singh, Huang Xiaolong, and Wang Xianghan$           
 62ZN2 H CIT=NDS 204, 1 (2025)$CUT=30-Jun-2023$                                 
 62ZN c  2021Go15: {+32}Si({+30}Si,X){+62}Zn{+*},E({+30}Si)=75,98 MeV; measured 
 62ZN2c  high-energy E|g, I|g using GALILEO array of 25 HPGe detectors and ten  
 62ZN3c  LaBr{-3}(Ce) scintillators at the Tandem accelerator facility of       
 62ZN4c  INFN-Legnaro. Deduced energies and widths of the Giant dipole          
 62ZN5c  resonance, isospin mixing parameter and isospin-symmetry-breaking      
 62ZN6c  correction by analyzing experimental |g-spectra using statistical      
 62ZN7c  model calculations.                                                    
 62ZN  L 18.4E3    1                   11.6 MEV  2                              
 62ZN cL $Energy and width of the GDR from data at E({+30}Si)=75 MeV.           
 62ZN2cL Corresponding values at E({+30}Si)=98 MeV are: E(GDR)=18.1 MeV {I1},   
 62ZN3cL |G(GDR)=12.6 MeV {I2} (2021Go15)                                       

 62ZN    58NI(4HE,XG):GDR              2024MO09                  25NDS    202507
 62ZN  H TYP=FUL$AUT=Balraj Singh, Huang Xiaolong, and Wang Xianghan$           
 62ZN2 H CIT=NDS 204, 1 (2025)$CUT=30-Jun-2023$                                 
 62ZN c  2024Mo09: E(|a)=28 MeV and 40 MeV. Measured E|g, I|g using the |l      
 62ZN2c  spectrometer consisting of                                             
 62ZN3c  49 BaF{-2} scintillators at K-130 cyclotron (VECC, Kolkata) and        
 62ZN4c  a low-energy |g ray multiplicity filter consisting of 50 BaF{-2}       
 62ZN5c  scintillators. Deduced parameters for GDR.                             
 62ZN  L 29.5E3                        6.7 MEV   3                              
 62ZN cL T$for GDR for T=0.9 MeV with SLO model.  Others: |G varies from 5.5    
 62ZN2cL to 7.9 MeV for different model parameters                              
 62ZN  L 40.8E3                        7.0 MEV   3                              
 62ZN cL T$for GDR for T=1.5 MeV with SLO model.  Others: |G varies from 6.6    
 62ZN2cL to 8.6 MeV for different model parameters                              

