 62ZN3c  Secondary beam energy approximately 165 AMeV. Measured E|g, I|g        
 62ZN4c  |g|g using the DALI2+ array consisting of 226 NaI(Tl) crystals.        
 62ZN5c  Data include inelastic scattering on natural carbon target.            
 62ZN6c  Comparison with the shell-model calculations with the                  
 62ZN7c  K3BGR (GXPF1A) effective interactions                                  
