 62GA3c  Measured isotopic half-life.                                           
 62GA c  Earlier secondary reports of production, identification and T{-1/2}    
 62GA2c  measurements: 1976BaXP, 1976JaZP                                       
 62GA c  Mass measurements: 2021Pa44, 2006Er03 (Penning trap), 2005Gu36         
 62GA c  1988Ga10: {+64}Zn({+6}Li,{+8}He) E=92.5, 98.9 MeV, no events for       
 62GA2c  {+62}Ga g.s. observed                                                  
 62GA c  Theoretical calculations: 23 primary references for structure          
 62GA2c  calculations and seven primary references for decay characteristics    
 62GA3c  of {+62}Ga can be retrieved from the NSR database at                   
 62GA4c  www.nndc.bnl.gov/nsr/                                                  
 62GA d  2007Mi19: calculated level energies from shell model                   
 62GA d  2004Gl01: calculated energy differences between T=0 and T=1 states,    
 62GA2d  and pair-transfer amplitudes                                           
 62GA d  2002Ba58, 2002Va21, 2001Ju06: calculated binding energies, J|p, level  
 62GA2d  energies. Interacting boson model.                                     
 62GA d  2002Sa38: calculated levels, J|p.  Deformed shell model with           
 62GA2d  isospin projection.                                                    
 62GA d  2001Ju02: calculated features of rotational bands, such as band        
 62GA2d  termination, quadrupole moments and pairing energy. Spherical shell    
 62GA3d  model, cranked Nilsson-Strutinsky model.                               
 62GA d  2001Sa39: calculated lowest T=0,1 level spectrum. Extended mean-field  
 62GA2d  model                                                                  
 62GA cG E,RI$Weighted averages from available data where uncertainties are     
 62GA2cG given. Exceptions are noted. Above 10 MeV excitation, all data are     
 62GA3cG from {+40}Ca({+28}Si,pn|a|g) in 2020Ru03. Intensities are relative     
 62GA4cG photon branching ratios                                                
 62GA cG M$From |g|g(|q)(DCO) data in {+40}Ca({+28}Si,pn|a|g) in 2020Ru03;      
 62GA2cG and |g|g(|q)(DCO) and |g(|q) data in {+40}Ca({+24}Mg,pn|g) in          
 62GA3cG 2004Ru03. For a few transitions assignments from |g(|q) data in        
 62GA4cG {+24}Mg({+40}Ca,pn|g) in 2013Da16, and DCO data in                     
 62GA5cG {+40}Ca({+24}Mg,pn|g) in 1998Vi06 are also available. Such             
 62GA6cG measurements are parity-insensitive, but with no evidence for          
 62GA7cG long-lived levels, |DJ=2, Q transitions are likely |DJ=2, E2,          
 62GA8cG and |DJ=1, D+Q as |DJ=1, M1+E2.                                        
