 62GA c  2021Or01: {+62}Ge isotope produced in {+9}Be({+78}Kr,X),E({+78}Kr)=345 
 62GA2c  MeV/nucleon reaction at the RIBF-RIKEN facility. Fragments were        
 62GA3c  separated, selected and identified in mass and charge by the BigRIPS   
 62GA4c  separator according to B|r-|DE-tof, and transported and implanted into 
 62GA5c  the WAS3ABi array consisting of three double-sided silicon-strip       
 62GA6c  detectors (DSSSDs) at the exit of the ZeroDegree spectrometer. The |g  
 62GA7c  rays were detected using the EURICA array of HPGe detectors. Measured  
 62GA8c  E|g, I|g, implant-decay time correlations. Deduced parent levels, J|p, 
 62GA9c  and Gamow-Teller strengths. See also 2023OrZZ.                         
 62GA d  2017RuZX is superseded by 2021Or01                                     
 62GA c  2014Gr10: study of Gamow-Teller decay of T=1, J|p=0+ {+62}Ge g.s. to   
 62GA2c  N=Z {+62}Ga nucleus. The {+62}Ge source was formed in fragmentation of 
 62GA3c  750 MeV/nucleon {+78}Kr beam impinging a {+9}Be target, followed by    
 62GA4c  B|r-|DE-B|r and time-of-flight analysis by using FRS fragment separator
 62GA5c  and various scintillation and ionization detectors at GSI facility. The
 62GA6c  ions of {+62}Ga were implanted into a pack of six 1 mm thick           
 62GA7c  double-sided silicon strip detectors (DSSSDs). Measured E|g, I|g,      
 62GA8c  (particle)|g-coin, (fragment)|b- and |b|g-coin, half-life of {+62}Ge   
 62GA9c  ground state. Deduced levels, J|p, |e feedings, log {Ift} values,      
 62GAAc  B(>) strengths. Comparison with shell model and QRPA calculations.     
