 62GA c  2022Mi15: E({+6}Li)=22 MeV from the IFIN-HH 9-MV Tandem accelerator.   
 62GA2c  Measured E|g, I|g, one- and two-neutron-gated |g spectra, angular      
 62GA3c  anisotropy for 978.1-keV transition using ROSPHERE array               
 62GA4c  with LaBr{-3}(Ce) and HPGe detectors, and an array of liquid           
 62GA5c  scintillator neutron detectors. Deduced energy of the first 2+ state,  
 62GA6c  Coulomb energy differences (CED), mirror energy differences (MED),     
 62GA7c  triplet energy differences (TED), and superallowed Fermi |b decays of  
 62GA8c  the ground states of {+62}Ga and {+62}Ge. Comparison with              
 62GA9c  beyond-mean-field complex excited Vampir variational model calculations
 62GAAc  using an effective interaction from a G matrix based on the            
 62GABc  charge-dependent Bonn Cd potential                                     
